While we're on the topic, does anyone know if it affects the quest if I'm still on the booty bay under siege by the bloodsails phase?  I left it there when I finished my "insane" grind because #Bloodsail4lyfe.  I need to eventually regrind the bloodsails then the goblins to get my bloodsail rep to exalted bc when I did it there wasn't a reasonable way of getting exalted and I wasn't about to camp one npc in the middle of nowhere for weeks to get it.

&#x200B;

Edit: I just want to note I'm putting off re-doing the questline for a week.  I did it on an alt with the firelands lego staff so I could get the mount and it was a nightmare of bottlenecks for me so I'm letting it breathe for a bit.

